# Frontend settings for PRODUCTION builds. Set these in your frontend host's
# dashboard (e.g. Netlify → Site configuration → Environment variables), or copy
# to client/.env.production before running "npm run build". Never put secrets here:
# everything starting with VITE_ ends up in the public JavaScript.
#
# Option A, one-service deployment (Render serves the website and the API):
#   keep /api, because the website and the API share one address.
# Option B, website on another host (e.g. Netlify) with the /api proxy from netlify.toml:
#   keep /api as well.
# Option C, website on another host calling the API directly:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://YOUR-ACTUAL-BACKEND-DOMAIN.onrender.com/api
#   (and on the server: CLIENT_ORIGIN=<website address>, COOKIE_SAME_SITE=none)
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
